    "work_id": "npnf-works/theophilus-of-alexandria-canonical-writings",
    "canonical_ref": "TheophAlex.Can.xxvi.4",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Let Bishop Apollo’s sentence against his priest Sur prevail, though he has the liberty of being further heard.",
