    "work_id": "npnf-works/theophilus-of-alexandria-canonical-writings",
    "canonical_ref": "TheophAlex.Can.xxvi.16",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "That an Œconomus be created, by the consent of all that are in Holy Orders, with the concurrence of Bishop Apollo, that so the goods of the Church be expended as they ought.",
