    "canonical_ref": "TheophAlex.Can.xxviii.1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Theophilus was informed, that the priest in Geminus, a village, had repelled Kyradium (a woman) from the communion: Theophilus approves of it, because she had done wrong, and was unwilling to make satisfaction; but orders her to be admitted to communion upon repentance.",
