    "canonical_ref": "TheophAlex.Can.xxix.1",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Because the great synod held at Nice has decreed, That [the clergymen] who come over to the Church from the Novatians be ordained; do you ordain those that come over, if their life be upright, and there be no objection.",
